	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030220"},
		line=1423,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"In the afternoon of the next day, I commence my infiltration of the Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"I lie in wait in the bed of the Koujiya Flowers shop van as it speeds through the Republican occupation zone.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
{"font", size=49},
"The Republican General Government Building, commonly known as the Government-General, is located in a complex running 2300 meters north to south and 1500 meters east to west.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"To call it heavily guarded would be an understatement; there are over 10,000 troops stationed on the premises, and a further 10,000 on standby at nearby garrisons.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"The Republicans also boast overwhelming firepower, as evidenced by the veritable columns of tanks and armored vehicles that can be seen even from the outside.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Rather than a seat of government, it'd be more accurate to call it a fortress.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"The building that Kanami is likely being held in is located near the center of the complex, about ten minutes by foot from the entrance.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"The van finally comes to a rest at the security checkpoint near the front gates.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Hello. Koujiya Flowers, here to deliver an order.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh, that's right. Here's my permit.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"We pass through the checkpoint without a hitch.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"We've made multiple deliveries here already, so they wave us through without suspecting anything.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"From here, it's a straight shot to the Government-General building.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Soujin-kun, the coast is all clear now.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Hearing the manager's signal, I poke my head out from the bed of flowers in the back.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Those roses sure scratched me up pretty badly.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Haha, even warriors are no match for a flower's thorns, eh?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Peeking outside, I spot patrols of soldiers everywhere I look.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"It would have been practically impossible to infiltrate successfully if it weren't for the shop's delivery van.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Opportunities such as this are one of the reasons I decided to work for Koujiya Flowers.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Are you sure I can just leave you behind?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yes. I've already caused you enough trouble as it is.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh, it's no trouble at all! But still...”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“At the very least, if you run into any problems, call me right away. I'll come as soon as I can.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you, manager.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Be careful out there.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I'd really prefer to not have to arrange your funeral bouquet.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh, I know! How 'bout a little touch of my nape, for good luck?”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's fine, thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"I slip out of the van in a nearby parking lot, and lie low in a thicket until nightfall.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"I patiently wait until the sun sets, and even further until the date eventually changes.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"After all this time, I've managed to fully memorize the patrol routes of the various sentries.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Time to make my move.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"I seize an opening in the patrols and rapidly scale up to the roof of the Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"I break the lock on a predetermined window with my spellblade and tumble into the building.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"After threatening a guard to reveal the location where Kanami is being held, I cleanly incapacitate him and rapidly make for the room in question.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"The room is completely dark and silent, save for the faint sound of breathing.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"There's a single girl lying asleep on the nearby bed.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"It has to be Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami, wake up.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Hah?!”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Kanami nimbly sits up at once and assumes a defensive posture.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now that's a daughter of House Tokita. Those are some good reactions.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii─”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"I put a hand over Kanami's mouth.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Keep your voice down.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Kanami gives a silent nod, and I remove my hand.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“What are you doing here?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm here to rescue you, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“To think that you would risk yourself, all for the likes of me...”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No matter what you've done, you're still my one and only sister.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Tears pool up in Kanami's round eyes.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Your Kanami disobeyed and betrayed you...”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When you exposed your identity?”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Kanami feebly nods, her tears spilling over.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"I cradle her tiny, trembling body in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You can explain yourself later.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But first, we have to get out of here. Okay?”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Kanami doesn't say a word, remaining frozen with her head buried in my chest.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I cannot allow myself to flee with you.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am sure to be pursued if I were ever to flee. I cannot allow myself to be a burden upon you, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You'll be killed if you stay here.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“That was always the end that I intended for myself. Your Kanami has made peace with that.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“To be able to see you one last time is already more happiness than she deserves.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Please, take your leave before you are discovered!”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Kanami pushes me away with all the strength in her feeble arms.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you're talking about atoning for impersonating the Empress, all is already forgiven.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"I grasp Kanami's hands in my own.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari said it herself.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She has nothing but gratitude for the Empress who healed the hearts of the people while she was unable to do anything.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She said that you deserve to be forgiven for everything.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Even so...”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...Onii-sama, would you ever grant me your forgiveness?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Imperial Princess has spoken. Of course I wouldn't have any objections.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Tears spill over once again from her quivering eyes.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's true that we'll be pursued if we run away, but that's hardly a problem.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“After all, those of us in the Blades have been on the run for years at this point.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"I show her my best smile in an attempt to assuage the doubts lingering in her heart.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Run away with me, Kanami. I swear I'll protect you.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Kanami leaps into my chest.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Khh?!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"The lights are flicked on all at once.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Before my eyes appears the imposing figure of Warren Valentine.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Aiming the barrel of a shotgun directly at us.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“A warrior, I presume.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Indee─”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"I barely manage to shield Kanami behind me.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Countless bullets gouge into my body.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gh...!”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"It feels like being struck by a giant mass of metal.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Blood gushes up from my stomach and spurts out from my mouth.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Not even conscious of having collapsed, I pitch forward and fall down face-first.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Chunks of my own flesh are scattered all about the room.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Having taken multiple shotgun blasts at point-blank range, I can't so much as move a single muscle.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The pool of blood expanding before my eyes proclaims the grievous danger to my life.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I'd decided to fire four shots if you were a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“O... O-Onii-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Kanami drapes herself over my prone body.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Stand up.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Shut it. On your feet.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Warren approaches, his gun trained on Kanami all the while.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Kanami stands up on trembling legs.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ka... na... mi...”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"I try to reach my hand out, but I can't so much as move a finger.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"The massive blood loss has my consciousness fading away with each passing second.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"With great effort, I manage to cast my eyes around the room to look for my spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"It must have rolled away when I fell, as it's lying a fair distance away.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"If only... I could reach...",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Now then.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“It's a little earlier than scheduled, but we'll conduct your execution now.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Are you intending to kill me?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Yes, what about it?”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“What about my trial? Am I not entitled to a trial?”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Even I should have the right to mount a defense.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"The Kanami I know would never say this.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"She's probably trying to stall for time.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Looking closer, Kanami is shifting ever so slightly as she meets Warren's gaze.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"She intends to go for my spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I was being threatened by Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“No matter how I refused, that man would not accept it.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“And so, I was forced to carry out Okonogi's orders!”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I beg your mercy! Please at least spare my life!”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am nothing but a victim!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Nice try.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“?!”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"There isn't a scratch on Kanami's body.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Instead, the spellblade is battered by a hail of bullets and sails into a faraway corner of the room.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I've been a soldier long before you were even in diapers.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I'm not about to fall for that.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"The still-smoking shotgun returns Kanami's fierce glare.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Seemingly resigned to her fate, Kanami falls to the ground in front of its muzzle.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"I can't move at all, and Kanami is defenseless.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"There's nothing within her reach that could be used as a weapon.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Well, it's the end of the line for you.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I don't know what your religion cares to teach you, but after you die, I hope you'll apologize to all the people you deceived.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Warren calmly cocks his shotgun and takes aim.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Governor-General! What do you think you're doing?!”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Warren's gaze flickers away from Kanami for an instant.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Now's my chance!",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"I muster up the last reserves of energy remaining in my body and leap at Warren.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Mmgh!?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"The bullets tear the flesh from my shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Rrraaaaaaarrrgh!”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Even so, I desperately cling to Warren's leg and grab at the barrel of the shotgun.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Damn pest.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Warren reaches for the holster at his hip.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"He smoothly draws an automatic pistol.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"In the next moment, its muzzle is pointed right between my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"He's fast─",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“This is the end.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"A dull sound rings throughout my skull.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"......",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Guugh... ugh...”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"A muffled gurgle escapes from Warren's throat.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"A glittering trinket pierces through his neck.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Crimson blood drips down from...",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"The tip of Kanami's hairpin.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Haah! Haah... haah...”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"I see.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Kanami stabbed Warren in the throat with her hairpin.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Kgh...”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Warren's legs collapse beneath him.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Just like that, he pitches forward and does not rise again.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Governor-General!”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Armed guards rush into the room, but I can no longer muster the energy to care.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii... sama...”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well done... Kanami...”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I have always been the daughter of warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Kanami smiles, her face on the verge of tears.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Her lovely hands are trembling in front of her.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But first, your injuries─”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah... I guess I'm not exactly... in the best shape.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"I struggle to even lift a single finger.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Lying there on the floor, the most I can do is contort my face into a semblance of a smile.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Do you have ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"any",
{"/font"},
" idea what you've just done?”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"The guards train their guns at me.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We surrender. Just don't hurt Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami, don't resist.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Kanami nods.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Take them into custody. See to the man's injuries.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Elsa crouches down by Warren's side as soon as she issues her orders.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"She touches her fingers to his neck and lets out a small sigh.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"There's no surviving that.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"But despite the fact that her father was just murdered before her eyes, she shows no signs of concern.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Once you've gotten first aid, you have some explaining to do.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"After some time, I'm discharged from the sick bay.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"My wounds are still deep, but thanks to the painkillers, I can at least manage a slow walk.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Apparently, the bullets lodged in my body slid out naturally like splinters.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"The army physicians went beyond shock and straight to fear.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Think you can manage to talk?”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"Out of consideration, Elsa instructed her guards to wait outside.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now then, you owe me an explanation.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There's nothing confusing about it.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I came on my own to rescue Kanami. Then Warren found us, and you saw the rest.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I can't believe Empress Hisui would kill the governor-general...”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“He tried to kill Kanami first. It was in self-defense.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I couldn't care less about pointless details like that.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Empire's head of state just killed the governor-general of the Republic!”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I don't have to tell you what will happen when the mainland finds out, do I?”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"It goes without saying that Kanami will be executed.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"On top of that, the Empire itself will be completely subjugated and absorbed as a vassal state of the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"The people will be forced to live as no better than slaves.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“All this after I barely managed to smooth over the incident at the ceremony... It's all come to naught.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I have no words, Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Your father... I...”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"Elsa drops her gaze.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"But she soon raises her eyes to meet Kanami's.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“He met a soldier's fate.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'd already given up on him. Don't let it bother you.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"Elsa declares with a tight expression.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did you intend to continue having Kanami act as Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yes. I'll need Empress Hisui's help if I want to bring democracy to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Both the warriors and Elsa want Empress Hisui to remain as she is.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"From what I saw in Tenkyo the past two days, many of the citizens share in this sentiment.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Can you arrange for me to be charged with killing the governor-general instead?”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama, what in the world are you saying?!”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A rogue vigilante warrior infiltrated the\ngovernor-general's office and assassinated him.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Empress Hisui was sleeping in a different room and never even realized anything was happening.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you can spin it well enough, Empress Hisui should be able to keep her status.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Please stop it! Your Kanami could never continue to live knowing of your sacrifice!”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Interesting...”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Ignoring Kanami's protests, Elsa thoughtfully crosses her arms.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"According to Koyuzu's report, Warren and Elsa had been arguing over Empress Hisui's planned execution.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Based on her reaction just now, Elsa was clearly opposed to it.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Not a bad idea.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If all goes well, we'll be able to retain the Imperial government.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Do not decide this all on your own!”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I refuse to serve as Empress if it requires Onii-sama's sacrifice.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If you would insist on coercing me, Elsa-sama, I will see to it that you meet your just reward.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And just what do you think you can do?”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I will end you.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I shall rally all the citizens and warriors in the land to massacre every last Republican.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"Her incandescent eyes threaten to immolate Elsa right where she stands.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Think you could manage that?”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama would be the hero who vanquished the governor-general.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If you dared to execute Onii-sama, the rage of the people would reach a boiling point.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I have no doubts that if their Empress but said the word, they would surely rise up.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If you start a revolt, it's your own country that'll be reduced to ash.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“There will be so much destruction that the war three years ago will look like nothing by comparison.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“That matters not to me.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“In exchange for Onii-sama's life, I would gladly burn this Empire to the ground.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"Kanami's eyes burn with an unquenchable resolve.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How silly of me to forget. Onii-sama always comes first, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Elsa smiles at the absurdity of it all.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But of course.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“However, that also means I would do anything at all in exchange for a guarantee of Onii-sama's safety.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I would gladly serve as your faithful puppet until the end of my days.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If you wished for me to die before the people, that would be no matter to me.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Looking to make a deal, are we?”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"In other words, if Elsa wants Kanami's cooperation, then she has to agree to save me.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"So long as I'm to take the fall for Warren's murder, even if she remains as Empress, Kanami will refuse to take Elsa's side.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"This proposition of hers is the only way she has to ensure that both of us can live to see another day.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If you succeed Warren's position, you would be able to shape the Empire to your will.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I believe this to be an eminently fair proposal. What say you?”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“There's no guarantee at all that I can become the next governor-general.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You would have my unconditional support as Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If I were to sign a petition endorsing you for the position, for example, would that not improve your prospects?”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I would not even have any opposition to marrying a Republican politician in exchange.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"She declares with a fervent resolution.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami, you...”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...You would go that far for Tokita-kun?”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“He is my life.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"Elsa purses her lips in thought.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I suppose that's that...”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Fine. I'll say Warren died suddenly of illness.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Nobody was involved in his death.”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Not Empress Hisui, and not any warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Would you really?”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You have my guarantee. All the soldiers who witnessed the scene answer directly to me. I can ensure their silence.”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But I'll see to it that you keep your promise.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"Elsa returns Kanami's stare.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" work to bring democracy to the Empire under my administration.”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“In time, the Imperial institution will be abolished, and this country will become an independent democracy.”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“That is all I wished for from the start.”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if you push for it, the warriors won't comply with that decision.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			{
"Even if they accept democratization, it will be difficult to abolish the Imperial system.",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"On top of that, Hotori and Akari know full well that Kanami is an impostor.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“They will comply.”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How do you plan to make that happen?”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I ask you, Onii-sama. Who is the reigning Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"Kanami asks me in a quiet, dignified voice.",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"Her countenance, a mask of determined purpose, radiates a regal beauty.",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			{
"Her steadfast visage projects her indominable will.",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"It's an expression whose master has drank deep of sin and sorrow, and therefore refuses to ever yield in her convictions.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"The aura she radiates has a quiet intensity about it.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
"It is not the aura of the ordinary Tokita Kanami or the illusory Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			{
"It is the august and cold command of a true sovereign.",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You are.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"Kanami has the unconditional support of the people behind her.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"Even if Akari were to declare herself the true Imperial Princess, with the evidence we have now, neither the warriors nor the people would easily believe her.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"In the worst case, it could even split public opinion and lead to a war of succession.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"That's the last thing Akari and I would want.",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“However, I still serve Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If Akari decides to oppose you, I will have no choice but to become your enemy once more.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I will persuade Akari-sama myself.”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I trust that you will.”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			{
"In that case, I have no further reservations.",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Are you quite finished?”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, there is one last request I would make of you.”",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“There's more?”",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“This is truly my final request.”",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			{
"Kanami straightens her back and entreats Elsa with all sincerity.",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Might I have just one single day with Onii-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If I am to continue living as Empress Hisui, never again will I have the opportunity to freely spend time with Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“All I ask is one day...”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I would even accept just the remainder of tonight!”",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I beg you, Elsa-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			{
"Kanami lowers herself before Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			{
"Her tenacity from moments before has all but vanished without a trace.",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll go ahead and grant Tokita Kanami's last request.”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But by the time you come back to me, you ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" be Empress Hisui.”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But of course.”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What say you, Tokita-kun?”",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I have no objections.”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			{
"Truth be told, I'm worried about leaving Kanami alone right now.",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Can I take Kanami with me?”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You can send someone to pick her up later.”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll give you until morning the day after tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			{
"Kanami turns to face me, her overflowing tears speaking to the depth of her feelings.",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All this time, I haven't been able to be there for her.”",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if it's just one single day, please, let me make it up to her.”",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm sure you know this, but...”",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't worry. I wouldn't betray your trust.”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
